-content content-type="citation-string">Baek, S.-S. &amp; Hwang, S.-H. Preparation of biomass-based transparent pressure-sensitive adhesives for optically clear adhesive and their adhesion performance. <italic>Eur. Polym. J.</italic><bold>92</bold>, 97–104 (2017).</named-content><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="google-scholar" xlink:href="Baek, S.-S. &amp; Hwang, S.-H. Preparation of biomass-based transparent pressure-sensitive adhesives for optically clear adhesive and their adhesion performance. Eur. Polym. J.92, 97–104 (2017)."/></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="CR14"><label>14.</label><mixed-citation id="mc-CR14"><named-content content-type="citation-string">Li, S., Liu, X., Li, R. &amp; Su, Y. Shear deformation dominates in the soft adhesive layers of the laminated structure of flexible electronics. <italic>Int. J. Solids Struct.</italic><bold>110–111</bold>, 305–314 (2017).</named-content><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="google-scholar" xlink:href="Li, S., Liu, X., Li, R. &amp; Su, Y. Shear deformation dominates in the soft adhesive layers of the laminated structure of flexible electronics. Int. J. Solids Struct.110–111, 305–314 (2017)."/></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="CR15"><label>15.</label><mixed-citation id="mc-CR15"><named-content content-type="citation-string">Jin, D. et al. Highly robust flexible AMOLED display on plastic substrate with new structure. <italic>SID Symp. Dig. Tech. Pap.</italic><bold>41</bold>, 703–705 (2010).</named-content><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="google-scholar" xlink:href="Jin, D. et al. Highly robust flexible AMOLED display on plastic substrate with new structure. SID Symp. Dig. Tech. Pap.41, 703–705 (2010)."/></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="CR16"><label>16.</label><mixed-citation id="mc-CR16"><named-content content-type="citation-string">Wang, H. et al. Investigating the dynamic mechanical behaviors of polyurea through experimentation and modeling. <italic>Def. Technol.</italic><bold>15</bold>, 875–884 (2019).</named-content><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="google-scholar" xlink:href="Wang, H. et al. Investigating the dynamic mechanical behaviors of polyurea through experimentation and modeling. Def. Technol.15, 875–884 (2019)."/></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="CR17"><label>17.</label><mixed-citation id="mc-CR17"><named-content content-type="citation-string">Qian, Z., Wang, J., Yang, J. &amp; Liu, S. Visco-elastic-plastic properties and constitutive modeling of underfills. <italic>IEEE Trans. Compon. Packag. Technol.</italic><bold>22</bold>, 152–157 (1999).</named-content><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="google-scholar" xlink:href="Qian, Z., Wang, J., Yang, J. &amp; Liu, S. Visco-elastic-plastic properties and constitutive modeling of underfills. IEEE Trans. Compon. Packag. Technol.22, 152–157 (1999)."/></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="CR18"><label>18.</label><mixed-citation id="mc-CR18"><named-content content-type="citation-string">He, T., Zhang, Z., Wang, S., Dong, F. &amp; Liu, S. A modified Qian-Liu constitutive model based on advanced packaging underfill materials. <italic>Mater. Sci. Semicond. Process.</italic><bold>176</bold>, 108340 (2024).</named-content><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="google-scholar" xlink:href="He, T., Zhang, Z., Wang, S., Dong, F. &amp; Liu, S. A modified Qian-Liu constitutive model based on advanced packaging underfill materials. Mater. Sci. Semicond. Process.176, 108340 (2024)."/></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="CR19"><label>19.</label><mixed-citation id="mc-CR19"><named-content content-type="citation-string">Wang, M., Chen, D., Feng, W. &amp; Zhong, A. Synthesis and characterization of optically clear pressure-sensitive adhesive. <italic>Mater. Trans.</italic><bold>56</bold>, 895–898 (2015).</named-content><ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/199